      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_LI_NA_001",
      "textZh": "房间比我想的还舒服。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 2,
      "file": "hsk2_sc036_line_002.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_ZHANG_WEI_001",
      "textZh": "而且很安静，窗外也不错。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 3,
      "file": "hsk2_sc036_line_003.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_LI_NA_001",
      "textZh": "我们先把东西放下吧。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 4,
      "file": "hsk2_sc036_line_004.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_ZHANG_WEI_001",
      "textZh": "这个小包真的够用了。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 5,
      "file": "hsk2_sc036_line_005.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_LI_NA_001",
      "textZh": "所以旅行不一定要带很多行李。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 6,
      "file": "hsk2_sc036_line_006.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_ZHANG_WEI_001",
      "textZh": "我已经学到了。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 7,
      "file": "hsk2_sc036_line_007.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_LI_NA_001",
      "textZh": "你累不累？",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 8,
      "file": "hsk2_sc036_line_008.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_ZHANG_WEI_001",
      "textZh": "有一点儿，不过休息十分钟就好。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 9,
      "file": "hsk2_sc036_line_009.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_LI_NA_001",
      "textZh": "晚上还想出去吗？",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 10,
      "file": "hsk2_sc036_line_010.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_ZHANG_WEI_001",
      "textZh": "想在附近走走，不想去太远。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 11,
      "file": "hsk2_sc036_line_011.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_LI_NA_001",
      "textZh": "那吃完晚饭以后走半小时。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 12,
      "file": "hsk2_sc036_line_012.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_ZHANG_WEI_001",
      "textZh": "明天早上呢？",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 13,
      "file": "hsk2_sc036_line_013.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_LI_NA_001",
      "textZh": "早点儿起来，看看早上的河边。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 14,
      "file": "hsk2_sc036_line_014.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_ZHANG_WEI_001",
      "textZh": "应该会比下午安静。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 15,
      "file": "hsk2_sc036_line_015.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_LI_NA_001",
      "textZh": "对，而且光线也好。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 16,
      "file": "hsk2_sc036_line_016.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_ZHANG_WEI_001",
      "textZh": "那今晚别睡太晚。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 17,
      "file": "hsk2_sc036_line_017.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_LI_NA_001",
      "textZh": "同意。旅行也要休息好。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 18,
      "file": "hsk2_sc036_line_018.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_ZHANG_WEI_001",
